DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");

$fun_1 = Formula("(2/((sin(x))))^2+5*((e^(x))*2)+2");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given this function:

[`[$fun_1]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(0) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->eval(x=>0)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
